# Strict allowlist — this repo lives in $HOME, so by default we IGNORE
# everything and only track files explicitly un-ignored below. If you ever
# `git add .` from here, only the allowlisted files will be picked up.

# Ignore everything at every level
*

# But allow these specific things
!.gitignore
!car-ownership-cost*.html

# Don't traverse into directories at all (extra safety)
*/
